{"id":"55664157-fb7f-4f14-a9a8-295e1a5e46fc","title":"Shifted Swirls 1","slug":"shifted-swirls-1","collectionSlug":"shifted-swirls","collectionName":"Shifted Swirls","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A smooth, flowing gradient shader effect dominated by warm and cool color transitions. The composition features a radial gradient emanating from the top-right corner (centered at coordinates 1,1) that transitions from pale cream/off-white (#f9ffbd) at the center through vibrant magenta-red (#eb0640) in the mid-tones to deep purple (#8a38ff) at the outer edges. The background is a solid magenta-pink tone that provides contrast. Ripple wave patterns are subtly visible throughout, creating concentric circular distortions that add dimensionality. A displacement map effect warps the gradient based on the ripple source, creating organic undulating surfaces with a mirror-edge behavior. The PixelThrow effect adds fine granular texture and subtle luminance-based particle scattering, creating a slightly grainy, organic quality to the otherwise smooth gradients. The overall effect is soft and blurred with gentle feathering at color boundaries, creating a dreamy, atmospheric quality. The aspect ratio is compressed (0.5), creating an elliptical rather than circular gradient spread. Tone mapping is set to ACES, enhancing color richness and contrast.","colors":["#f9ffbd","#eb0640","#8a38ff","#ff69b4"],"labels":["gradient","organic","vibrant","calm"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/55664157-fb7f-4f14-a9a8-295e1a5e46fc.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"Ripples","id":"idmsx81sj7r8hp63y3d","_key":"key_msx81sj7r8hp63y3d","props":{"phase":0,"speed":1,"center":{"x":1,"y":1},"colorA":"#ffffff","colorB":"#000000","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","softness":1.1,"blendMode":"normal","frequency":8.3,"thickness":0.5,"transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0}}},{"type":"RadialGradient","id":"idmsx7yjm